  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/51YFy9K.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"776\" height=\"444\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>描述：</strong></span></p>\n<p>本模组在6种类型中添加了超过200种灯光变体，并为部分灯光提供了火焰、灵魂火焰和常亮版本。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/6UXDAER.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"385\" height=\"769\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>更新日志：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>v3.1</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- 基座现在支持比较器输出。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>v3.0</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Cckat5N.png\" width=\"406\" height=\"302\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>v2.2</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- 为所有 Additional Lights 配方添加了配方书解锁（进度）<br>- 添加了启用/禁用火焰/灵魂火焰合成配方的配置选项（默认：关闭）<br>&nbsp; （Fabric版：需要安装 Mod Menu 和 Cloth Config API 才能修改配置，但模组本身无需它们即可运行）</span></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">v2.1</span></strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/5jSaxxF.png\" width=\"441\" height=\"110\"></p>\n<p><strong>v2.0</strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/5UW5kFL.png\" width=\"434\" height=\"332\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>注意：</strong></span></p>\n<p>火坑和站立火把可以通过右键点击点燃。</p>\n<p>它们也需要占据2个方块的空间。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/msZmser.png\" width=\"343\" height=\"224\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/OhH1pfG.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"190\" height=\"337\"></p>\n<p>你可以使用灵魂法杖将其转化为灵魂火焰。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/cFAJldB.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"388\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>特性：</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:12px\">- 火焰不会造成任何伤害，无火灾风险。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:12px\">- 灵魂火焰的亮度为10。</span></li>\n<li>- 潜行放置时不会被点燃。在被破坏前会拒绝接收信号。</li>\n<li>- [1.16]&nbsp;猪灵害怕灵魂火焰。（普通火把无效）</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>截图：</strong></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/V1dXQj4.png\" width=\"811\" height=\"464\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/u3s1aSP.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"811\" height=\"464\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/s262Tie.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"811\" height=\"464\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/xCqX2Sy.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"811\" height=\"464\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/IBp8Ktp.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"811\" height=\"464\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/GgjVXZy.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"811\" height=\"464\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/JIlDVu9.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"811\" height=\"464\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/a/GBc4Qdr\" alt=\"\" width=\"Infinity\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/URf80n1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"811\" height=\"465\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/GM8W4wF.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"811\" height=\"465\"></p>\n<p>（拍摄环境：纹理包：Faithful x32，光影包：BSL v7.1.05p2，地图：Falcon's Rock v2.0.0）</p>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>本模组的 Faithful x32 材质包可在此下载。<br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/additional-lights/download/3001273\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/additional-lights/download/3001273</a></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>您可以自由地将本模组包含在整合包中。</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>",
